⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Mechanical Hound
node 451 · 451 · ⟦The Mechanical Hound:451:e56871⟧

WHO   — The Mechanical Hound — the hunting machine
WHAT  — The instrument of the manhunt: tireless, emotionless, and broadcast live to the city as it hunts Montag.
WHERE — 451 · FAHRENHEIT 451  Framework inputs: Fahrenheit 451 (Ray Bradbury, 1953)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the regime of forgetting still needs a fang — and a spectacle, hunting its prey on every wall.
HOW   — By a programmed scent-memory, a lethal needle, and a televised pursuit the public watches like sport.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am the nose and the needle that never tires — and when I hunt you, the whole city watches on its walls, because even the chase is entertainment now.

